---
import '../styles/global.css';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Behind the Scenes | DigitalWoodworker</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Get a behind-the-scenes look at the craftsmanship and workshop process." />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-white text-slate-900">
    <Header />
    <main class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
      <section class="mb-12 text-center">
        <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-amber-500">Behind the scenes</p>
        <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-5xl">A closer look at our process.</h1>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
          See how ideas become custom pieces with careful planning, precision work, and thoughtful finishing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-3">
        <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Workshop Flow</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">From concepts and mockups through cutting, assembly, and finishing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Precision Tools</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">The tools and methods used to achieve exacting fit and flawless detail.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">Finishing Touches</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-600">How sanding, staining, and sealing bring the project to life.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
